<title>USA: New Haven Schools, Mich., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>New Haven Schools, Mich., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin, Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc said it won $7.850 million of New Haven Community Schools, Mich., 1997 general obligation school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.21 percent.</p>
</text>
